	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "RichWave RTC6705 5.8 GHz FM transmitter, QFN-40 6x6 mm P0.5, EP 4.42 = GND (41). Land copied from the OpenVTX library (QFN-40_L6.0-W6.0-P0.50-BL-EP = EasyEDA C913074: 0.28 x 0.66 at 2.91), re-oriented to pin 1 top-left; RTC6705 DS V0.2 has no land pattern (pins p3-4, package p11-12). EP paste 3x3 x 1.20 mm (66 %); EP vias placed on the board (P5). DENSE: toe trimmed to 3.20 (land envelope 6.40 = area budget) and the data-sheet NC pads 2, 12, 18, 36, 37 removed (D21 trimmed_footprint). | V4 (D95): RTC6705: EP land 4.42 -> 2.90 (43 %), land holds 3x3 board GND vias at 0.90 (via-in-pad, placed on the board), paste 2x2 1.00 (48 %); 14 open lands removed (SPI_SE 1, S 3, BX 4, RF_VT2 11, audio 13-17/19-21, REG1D8 26, PAOUT2 34)")
	(tags "QFN-40 RTC6705 VTX 5.8GHz OpenVTX V4 D95")
